    "note": "displacement is a VOLUME in m^3 for this API: the geometry gate of calculations/resistance rejects L*B*T*Cb vs displacement mismatch >= 5 % (a call with displacement=45000.0 was rejected with 'displacement=45000.0 m3 ... 相差 15.46%'). The propulsion endpoint accepts the same 45000.0 without that gate and returns identical numbers, i.e. it does not consume displacement at all.",
