      "prop_pitch_field_semantics": "prop_pitch is read as the P/D RATIO, not as a pitch length: a call with prop_pitch=5.4 and prop_diameter=6.0 returned validity note 'P/D=5.400 超出 B 系列回归有效域 [0.5, 1.4]'"
